<item><title>Bank of Mauritius sells $15 million as consumer advocate questions results</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-sells-15-million-as-consumer-advocate-080e5b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-sells-15-million-as-consumer-advocate-080e5b/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The November 18 sale brought its 2026 currency interventions to about $170 million, while the rupee lost 2.2% against the dollar from January to October.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:30:17 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-sells-15-million-as-consumer-advocate-080e5b/share.jpg" length="42526" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/bank-of-mauritius-sells-15-million-as-consumer-advocate-080e5b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
